- Data size is not fixed; the payload is a file (flexible size, tentatively ranging from 1 KB to 100 MB: 1 KB, 10 KB, 100 KB, 1 MB, 10 MB, 100 MB).
- Report performance metrics (cycle count and execution time) for each step of the handshake and data exchange. 
